IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ehi {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, che si dice?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Allora, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}siamo in un sogno o sbaglio?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Che sollievo, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Finalmente posso essere me stesso{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
e smetterla di preoccuparmi di
come mi vedono gli altri. {{TAG:0003:002A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Che storia!

Ehi, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ti va di fare due salti con me?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Uhuuuuu! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}Yeeeeeah! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sììì, mi piace da matti ballare!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ma solo in posti come questo.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
E solo con gli amici dei miei sogni!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} If this is a dream,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
why does it feel like a real place?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Probably because you're here.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yup, you're as real as it gets,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

